<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I must tell Jesus all of my troubles;</l><l>He is a kind, compassionate Friend;</l><l>If I but ask Him, He will deliver,</l><l>And in my griefs with me He will blend.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Tempted and tried I need a great Savior,</l><l>One who can help my burdens to bear;</l><l>I must tell Jesus, I must tell Jesus;</l><l>He all my cares and sorrows will share,</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>O how the world to evil allures me!</l><l>O how my heart is tempted to sin!</l><l>I must tell Jesus; He will enable</l><l>Over the world the vic’try to win.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
